@@ -0,0 +1,71 @@
+# Quadify Empowered
+
+Quadify Empowered is a personal, community mod pack built on top of a normal
+Sable installation for Volumio 4. It keeps Sable as the player-panel platform;
+it does not replace Volumio, TIDAL or the original Sable project.
+
+## Install
+
+Install Volumio and Sable normally first. Then use this repository as the
+Sable source and run the standard installer:
+
+```sh
+git clone https://github.com/graemedench/quadify_empowered.git /home/volumio/sable
+cd /home/volumio/sable
+sudo bash install.sh
+```
+
+Reboot once if the installer adds SPI, I2C or IR kernel overlays.
+
+### Graeme FM4 preset
+
+For the FM4 used to develop this mod pack, run:
+
+```sh
+sudo bash install.sh --graeme
+```
+
+This restores the personal display/audio/IR preferences and the 5–7 shortcut
+defaults. It does not copy hardware wiring overrides, network credentials,
+TIDAL login details or playlists.
+
+## Added behaviour
+
+- Reliable OLED boot/reinitialisation and an early front-panel LED readiness
+  flourish.
+- A looping startup LED route: **1 → 2 → 4 → 6 → 5 → 3 → 1**.
+- Modern panel, cinema, spectrum, VU and performance display modes, including
+  a compact unboxed playback-mode indicator.
+- Pause/stop improvements: holding play pauses immediately, shows a discreet
+  stopped state with LEDs dark, then performs the real stop after five minutes.
+- Front-panel playback modes: Play Single, Play All, Repeat Single, Repeat All
+  and Shuffle.
+- TIDAL/radio source switching that avoids stale metadata and temporary clock
+  flashes.
+- Button 8 tap saves the current track to the real **Quadify** TIDAL playlist.
+  Holding it opens **Save Shortcut**: press 5, 6 or 7, choose short or long
+  with the encoder, then press the encoder to confirm.
+- Settings → Shortcuts can restore buttons 5–7 to the selected profile's
+  defaults.
+- Button 5/6/7 short and long assignments persist in `settings.json`; Sable
+  remembers TIDAL mixes that it started and reusable radio stream URLs.
+- Long press on the encoder exits any menu or browse depth straight to Now
+  Playing.
+- On-screen network status (wired/Wi-Fi name and IP) plus Wi-Fi joining.
+- General detected-output menu, plus the optional personal fixed/variable
+  line-out and headphone-output menu.
+- IR receiver support and the verified Apple Aluminium Remote profile.
+- Graceful shutdown using the dedicated BCM21 input.
+
+## Keeping changes across updates
+
+Your runtime choices live in `/home/volumio/sable/config/settings.json` and
+are intentionally not committed. Before an update, use `sable-backup`; after
+an update re-run `sudo bash install.sh` and restart/reboot as appropriate.
+
+## Rights
+
+This mod pack is free for personal use. Commercial sale rights remain with the
+original Quadify creator/publisher. The original Quadify publisher is welcome
+to use these additions commercially. Sable and its dependencies remain subject
+to their own upstream licences.
