+# Library refresh and storage settings
+
+Settings > Music Library offers Refresh now and Auto refresh (Off, 15 minutes,
+or hourly). This Pi is configured for 15 minutes. Requests use Volumio's
+updateDb API for an incremental library update. Periodic requests wait while
+a CD rip is active; disconnected/ripping retries are limited to once per minute.
+The installed MPD configuration has auto_update disabled and Volumio's fswatch
+call is commented out. No Volumio core or system configuration was changed.
+
+Settings > Storage lists Internal Storage and mounted USB/network volumes.
+Each row shows free decimal GB; select a row for free/total capacity. Reopen
+the list to refresh drive detection and capacity. Unmounted drives are omitted.
+
+Validation: two focused library/storage tests, five menu tests and eighteen
+CD/boot tests passed. Storage preview rendered from this Pi's real storage.
+No restart or reboot performed. Changes load on the next Sable start.
